### Root Cause #4 — `hasResult` gate in `QuickActionState` blocks Fresh STBs

**File:** `lib/application/providers/quick_action_provider.dart`
**Line:** 70

```dart
bool get hasResult => customerId != null && customerId!.isNotEmpty;
```

When a Fresh STB is searched by **serial number or VC number** (not by customer name/mobile/account), the search path calls `getCustomerDetailsRest`. If no customer exists for that STB (true fresh box), the response will return an empty list, causing `hasResult = false` and no action buttons to appear. **The user may not be able to reach the New Customer button at all** via Quick Action serial search.

